{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Makes a New Friend"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "I Want to Find Someone Who ... "}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Future tense (<span class=\"strong\">will</span>) to talk about actions in the future. You can also use the modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> to talk about possible actions in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">will </span>goes before the verb. The short form is \u2018ll."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Future tense when you talk about the future, make offers or make predictions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> go before the verb. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "They talk about future possibility or chance that something will happen. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Might </span>means there is a smaller chance that something will happen (30%)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">May</span> means there is a slightly greater chance that something will happen (50%)."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll decide in the morning."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I might go shopping."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I may go shopping, too. I'm free."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Agreeing and Disagreeing Tactfully"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use different phrases to agree and disagree tactfully (politely). <br> Look at the chart below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Agreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Disagreeing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I agree with you 100 percent.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't think so.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I couldn't agree with you more.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm afraid I disagree.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's so true.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm afraid I don't agree.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You're absolutely right.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Not necessarily.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Absolutely.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's not always true.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's exactly how I feel.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"No, I'm not so sure about that.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exactly.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I see what you're saying, but ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You have a point there.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't know about that ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mysterious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult to understand or know"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like my men mysterious and quiet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to describe people."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being quiet and reserved around other people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is shy and quiet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "honest"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "truthful; sincere"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like it when people are honest about what they want."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "forward"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not afraid to say what you are thinking"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The men here are a little too forward."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hot"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "casual language to describe a good-looking person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The men here are so hot!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "direct "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "straight to the point"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like it when people are direct and honest."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le06ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list 5 adjectives to describe someone's personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask different people if those words describe them. For example: <span class=\"italic\">Are you honest? Tell me more.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the person's name next to the adjective."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your results with other classmates."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe people with a variety of words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk with different people about their personalities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare the results with others in my class."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le06ob01re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le06ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, Vanessa! How are things with you? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, Sally. Things are good. Work is really busy. What's up with you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm traveling around the Middle East at the moment. The men here are so hot!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Tell me more!<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le06ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They're all dark and handsome. Just my type! They are a little too forward, though.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, I like it when men are  direct and honest about what they want. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't know about that ... a little mystery is exciting, too. I like my men mysterious and a little shy. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : I see what you're saying but I prefer to know how they feel and what they're thinking!<br>", "id": 2, "time": "16500", "image": "engenn5le06ob01re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: To each their own, I suppose. What will you do tomorrow?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I might go shopping ... I'll decide in the morning. You?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I may do some shopping, too. I'd like to get some souvenirs. <br>", "id": 3, "time": "40000", "image": "engenn5le06ob01re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob01re6aud04", "coverimg": "engenn5le06ob01re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le06ob01re6aud04"}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can agree and disagree tactfully."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe people's personality."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about things, actions and events in the future."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What kind of person are you? Describe yourself in three words."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What qualities do you look for in a boyfriend/girlfriend?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "To each their own ... I suppose."}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text"